# --- excluded from the public repo ---
# Résumé carries a phone number, postal details and a location. The site
# deliberately publishes none of those (see the note in data/profile.ts), so
# shipping the PDF in a public repo would undo that decision.
docs/Resume.pdf

# Same reason, verified by scanning the tree rather than assumed: the strategy
# deck repeats the phone number across 96 pages, and SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md carries
# it on an explicit "Phone:" line.
docs/Cybersecurity-Portfolio-Project-Strategy.pdf
docs/SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md

# Third-party design references (Airbnb, Apple, Airtable et al) vendored for
