awesome-design-md-main/

# Local machine paths and per-user tool permissions.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent tooling. CLAUDE.md is re-written by `next dev` on every run (see the
# note in AGENTS.md), so ignoring it is the only thing that keeps it from
# reappearing in a later commit. Both stay on disk; they are just not published.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
